WEBVTT

00:04.230 --> 00:06.360
Please, hold on!

00:08.260 --> 00:10.240
Please...

00:15.580 --> 00:17.690
We came this far.

00:18.240 --> 00:22.250
I can't let everyone down.

00:24.140 --> 00:25.790
I don't want that.

00:29.530 --> 00:31.090
Still...

00:31.440 --> 00:33.800
if you do anything rash right now, your leg will never...

00:33.800 --> 00:36.140
It'll be all right if I take a little break.

00:36.670 --> 00:39.310
I don't want to give up.

00:40.220 --> 00:41.440
That's right.

00:41.440 --> 00:44.020
It's too early to give up.

00:44.020 --> 00:50.020
If a regular member for the medley relay is hurt, you are allowed to have four alternates!

00:50.440 --> 00:53.570
So Amuro, you have to swim in the finals.

00:53.570 --> 00:54.280
Finals?

00:57.120 --> 00:58.870
Me?

00:59.220 --> 01:01.240
Amuro, you're the only one.

01:20.180 --> 01:25.020
We will now begin the girls' medley relay finals.

01:25.020 --> 01:27.770
It's finally my turn!

01:27.770 --> 01:30.530
Like I said, only girls who have been registered can swim!

01:30.530 --> 01:33.040
Call me Mari!

01:33.040 --> 01:34.530
He's not even listening.

01:34.970 --> 01:39.600
Third lane, from Kanagawa. Shinomiya University High School.

01:41.040 --> 01:44.540
Of course, we will make the inter-highs by placing first.

01:44.970 --> 01:49.250
Fourth lane, from Kanagawa. Umineko Shougyou High School.

01:50.710 --> 01:52.710
I'm going to do my best!

01:52.710 --> 01:55.340
Umisho, let's do it!

01:55.340 --> 01:56.550
Do your best!

01:59.810 --> 02:03.630
Oh, Zuka-san isn't the anchor.

02:03.630 --> 02:06.350
Well, it wouldn't matter who races with me.

02:07.120 --> 02:10.790
Fifth lane, from Saitama. Tamatsuka Academy.

02:13.760 --> 02:16.030
My stomach hurts...

02:16.030 --> 02:19.910
I see, Ninagawa-san is swimming.

02:21.120 --> 02:25.370
It looks like Tamatsuka's cheering team isn't going to sing in the finals.

02:25.370 --> 02:27.390
Maidens...

02:27.390 --> 02:29.630
After what happened in the preliminaries, I can't blame them.

02:31.890 --> 02:34.130
I'm going to do my best!

02:36.260 --> 02:39.130
Do your best, Maaya-san!

02:39.130 --> 02:41.300
Orizuka-senpai.

02:46.050 --> 02:47.110
You guys...

02:47.110 --> 02:48.140
I'm counting on you...

02:48.550 --> 02:49.690
Ready!

02:52.890 --> 02:53.970
Please...

02:53.970 --> 02:54.650
everyone...

02:57.190 --> 02:59.450
Maaya-san had a perfect start!

02:59.450 --> 03:01.200
Actually, all the teams had a perfect start!

03:01.550 --> 03:02.440
Are you serious?

03:02.440 --> 03:03.610
Amazing...

03:05.800 --> 03:07.420
These are the finals for you...

03:13.620 --> 03:15.650
Takeda-kun, you brought a video camera.

03:15.650 --> 03:16.950
Make sure you videotape everyone.

03:16.950 --> 03:18.960
Leave it to me.

03:16.950 --> 03:18.960
Do your best!

03:20.350 --> 03:21.310
Hey!

03:21.870 --> 03:23.260
Captain!

03:23.260 --> 03:24.470
You're in the way!

03:30.480 --> 03:31.730
Damn...

03:31.730 --> 03:33.190
I can't get ahead of them.

03:33.590 --> 03:35.510
Maaya, don't rush!

03:35.510 --> 03:36.900
Maaya-san...

03:36.900 --> 03:38.850
Maaya-san, do your best!

03:38.850 --> 03:40.450
Umisho, let's go!

03:40.840 --> 03:43.000
Maaya looks sluggish.

03:43.000 --> 03:45.410
She must have used too much energy in the individual races and the preliminaries.

03:48.810 --> 03:50.410
Nanako-san...

03:52.960 --> 03:54.170
They turned!

03:54.170 --> 03:56.520
Only 50 meters left!

03:57.670 --> 03:59.510
I can't see the pool!

03:59.510 --> 04:00.880
C-Captain!

04:02.280 --> 04:04.430
Please sit still until the race finishes.

04:06.520 --> 04:08.180
Only 10 meters left!

04:08.980 --> 04:12.400
Tamatsuka, Shinomiya, and Umisho are neck and neck.

04:15.090 --> 04:17.360
Kise-senpai starts at third place.

04:23.630 --> 04:25.990
Damn, everyone is fast.

04:25.990 --> 04:28.080
Did they save their energy during the preliminaries?

04:33.410 --> 04:35.380
I can't lose.

04:35.380 --> 04:37.080
Zuka, watch me.

04:38.290 --> 04:39.840
Sanae.

04:40.720 --> 04:42.380
They're starting to increase the lead!

04:42.740 --> 04:44.590
If we stay in third place, we'll be sitting ducks.

04:44.590 --> 04:47.010
Stay on them, stay on them!

04:48.850 --> 04:51.420
I-I have to do my best...

04:51.420 --> 04:52.810
I have to do something...

04:53.810 --> 04:56.860
The next swimmer is Shizuoka-san.

04:56.860 --> 04:59.110
Kise-san, do your best!

04:59.110 --> 05:00.860
Senpai, let's go!

05:03.360 --> 05:05.170
Kise-senpai!

05:05.170 --> 05:06.370
Do your best!

05:12.210 --> 05:13.830
I have to do something.

05:17.240 --> 05:19.090
I'm going to get her from behind.

05:19.090 --> 05:21.340
Umisho is behind!

05:21.340 --> 05:23.300
Kise-senpai, 10 meters left.

05:24.550 --> 05:27.840
I... I have to relax like I usually do.

05:28.260 --> 05:29.890
T-That's right...

05:29.890 --> 05:32.350
In order to be my usual self...

05:32.740 --> 05:35.850
It's... embarrassing, but...

05:37.940 --> 05:39.850
This is a nice angle.

05:47.610 --> 05:49.830
It's a butt...

05:53.340 --> 05:56.380
Shizuoka-senpai starts at seventh place!

05:56.380 --> 05:58.660
Go big boobs!

06:01.350 --> 06:02.790
Damn it...

06:02.790 --> 06:03.590
I'll leave the rest to you.

06:08.470 --> 06:10.840
She's swimming more dynamically than she ever swam before!

06:12.300 --> 06:14.350
Shizuoka-san's butt is...

06:14.700 --> 06:20.060
W-What happened to Shizuoka-san?

06:26.360 --> 06:29.620
Shizuoka-san passed a swimmer and is in sixth place!

06:32.620 --> 06:34.590
You're doing great, big boobs!

06:34.590 --> 06:36.740
Catch up, catch up!

06:37.980 --> 06:39.120
We're still in sixth.

06:39.580 --> 06:41.630
Will we be okay?

06:44.340 --> 06:45.900
Shizuoka-san!

06:45.900 --> 06:47.050
Do your best!

06:49.090 --> 06:51.600
Umisho, let's go!

06:51.600 --> 06:53.600
Don't give up yet!

06:54.020 --> 06:55.450
Do your best...

06:55.450 --> 06:56.560
Mirei-san...

06:56.560 --> 06:59.170
Umisho, let's go!

06:59.670 --> 07:05.110
A-Amuro-senpai will do something about it.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.420
Not yet.

07:06.420 --> 07:08.110
You better not commit a false start.

07:08.580 --> 07:09.960
You guys...

07:15.360 --> 07:19.370
The first that wins in the end gets everything.

07:19.370 --> 07:23.050
Stay right there and watch my swimming style!

07:29.670 --> 07:33.810
Is the wall for the inter-highs impossible to jump over?

07:35.240 --> 07:36.310
Please...

07:40.910 --> 07:43.310
Amuro!

07:46.090 --> 07:48.530
Swim your heart out!

07:49.860 --> 07:51.280
Kaname-chan.

07:53.190 --> 07:56.290
Grandma, lend me your power.

08:05.450 --> 08:07.000
She jumped?!

08:13.600 --> 08:16.310
She already passed one person!

08:19.510 --> 08:22.640
Go, X-girl!

08:23.900 --> 08:25.690
The fourth lane is catching up.

08:25.690 --> 08:27.780
Umisho's fast.

08:27.780 --> 08:29.450
What's with that swimming style?

08:29.800 --> 08:31.740
What's with her?!

08:31.740 --> 08:33.400
She's not using the crawl!

08:33.910 --> 08:34.960
Cheering?

08:34.960 --> 08:36.450
Is it Ninagawa Amuro?!

08:37.620 --> 08:40.970
I've never seen Senpai so serious!

08:43.970 --> 08:45.000
Amazing...

08:45.000 --> 08:45.670
She might be able to...

08:47.050 --> 08:48.380
Ninagawa-san?!

08:49.900 --> 08:51.970
She's upside down!

08:51.970 --> 08:53.930
She's swimming at a 45 degree angle?!

08:53.930 --> 08:55.430
How does she plan on turning?!

09:05.790 --> 09:06.950
At that moment...

09:09.690 --> 09:11.610
Amuro looks like...

09:13.200 --> 09:14.150
As if...

09:19.770 --> 09:21.370
She was a mermaid...

09:25.420 --> 09:27.420
Ninagawa Amuro, you're here!

09:27.420 --> 09:29.920
The only person who gets the last laugh is the winner.

09:32.170 --> 09:33.670
What?!

09:34.540 --> 09:36.680
The three teams are neck and neck!

09:36.680 --> 09:39.180
Go!

09:45.610 --> 09:47.310
Yes!

09:47.310 --> 09:49.680
A huge comeback!

09:50.480 --> 09:51.970
Yes!

09:51.970 --> 09:53.500
Awesome!

09:53.500 --> 09:54.580
We did it.

09:56.710 --> 09:58.200
All right.

10:01.120 --> 10:02.200
Awesome!

10:07.320 --> 10:10.420
You're awesome!

10:12.220 --> 10:13.370
Thank goodness.

10:13.370 --> 10:14.970
Thank goodness! Thank goodness!

10:14.970 --> 10:16.340
Thank...

10:20.970 --> 10:22.760
Hey, Okky...

10:22.760 --> 10:25.230
Are you two going out?

10:25.790 --> 10:27.210
N-No...

10:28.510 --> 10:30.240
Senpai...

10:32.570 --> 10:34.190
Hey, you guys...

10:36.320 --> 10:37.330
Why did you...

10:38.850 --> 10:40.420
guys do this...

10:42.040 --> 10:44.420
when I'm not here...?

10:52.590 --> 10:53.810
Thank you...

10:54.700 --> 10:55.920
Really...

10:56.830 --> 10:57.900
Thank you...

10:59.210 --> 11:02.260
Sanae, and Nanako-san...

11:02.260 --> 11:05.700
Shizuoka, and Ninagawa-san...

11:07.510 --> 11:08.450
You guys...

11:13.220 --> 11:14.350
You idiot.

11:14.350 --> 11:15.510
Don't cry.

11:15.510 --> 11:17.280
We still have the inter-highs.

11:20.000 --> 11:20.990
You're right.

11:21.560 --> 11:23.140
Let's do our best!

11:23.140 --> 11:24.320
The final day!

11:24.320 --> 11:24.990
Yes!

11:27.100 --> 11:29.020
Um, Shizuoka-san.

11:30.950 --> 11:32.630
You should probably fix your behind...

11:37.510 --> 11:38.760
Oma.

11:40.580 --> 11:42.280
You guys are great, Umisho.

11:42.280 --> 11:44.280
We'll see you at the inter-highs.

11:45.960 --> 11:47.980
Damn you, Umisho.

11:47.980 --> 11:51.520
I'll get back at you at the inter-highs.

11:51.870 --> 11:54.480
Now, let's get going.

11:57.140 --> 11:59.740
And then, the third day of the Kantou tournament arrived.

12:00.910 --> 12:05.490
With Umisho on a streak, the swimmers made it into the inter-highs one by one.

12:30.800 --> 12:33.060
The Kantou tournament is over, huh?

12:34.900 --> 12:35.840
Yeah.

12:37.410 --> 12:40.610
But we grew up; even the others.

12:41.170 --> 12:42.200
Yep.

12:46.580 --> 12:53.130
Come to think of it, the second year swimmers were so naive.

12:53.130 --> 12:55.120
Nice to meet you.

12:55.400 --> 12:58.840
Yep, yep, Okiura was trying to learn how to swim then.

12:59.190 --> 13:03.090
Shizuoka has grown a lot since then, too.

13:05.290 --> 13:06.330
Awesome!

13:06.330 --> 13:07.930
You have these, and you're still a first year in high school!

13:07.930 --> 13:09.600
Um, Senpai.

13:09.600 --> 13:13.000
The others changed, too.

13:13.000 --> 13:15.900
Actually, it was more like they revealed their true colors.

13:19.700 --> 13:23.600
The first years we got this year and Ninagawa-san are promising.

13:23.600 --> 13:24.820
Makio-chan, too?

13:24.820 --> 13:26.700
Before!

13:25.150 --> 13:26.700
What are you talking about?

13:26.700 --> 13:28.350
She's grown, too.

13:26.700 --> 13:28.350
After!

13:28.880 --> 13:30.200
Afore!

13:30.200 --> 13:31.040
Really?

13:32.590 --> 13:35.580
Those three years went by fast.

13:37.240 --> 13:39.740
I think I might be satisfied.

13:41.470 --> 13:44.100
We built the swim team on our own.

13:44.100 --> 13:46.930
And then there are juniors who joined our team.

13:47.570 --> 13:51.600
And those juniors did their best to fill in for me.

13:51.990 --> 13:57.060
I don't have a problem with retiring right now.

13:57.960 --> 13:59.130
Zuka...

14:00.610 --> 14:03.570
Hey, hey, the real thing is coming up.

14:07.760 --> 14:09.570
All right, if it comes down to it...

14:09.570 --> 14:11.120
You idiot!

14:14.610 --> 14:15.750
Like that.

14:17.030 --> 14:21.840
Zuka, bring back your fighting spirit!

14:21.840 --> 14:27.300
But it'll be bad for them if we didn't win in the inter-highs.

14:28.950 --> 14:30.520
What's with that pose?

14:30.520 --> 14:31.850
Uki.

14:32.350 --> 14:35.810
Zuka, you've grown, too.

14:36.160 --> 14:39.000
We're gonna do our best at the inter-highs!

14:40.170 --> 14:41.500
So old.

14:41.500 --> 14:43.570
But, I guess I'll do it, too.

14:43.570 --> 14:46.610
Beat down Shinomiya!

14:47.780 --> 14:50.070
Beat them!

14:51.000 --> 14:53.720
We won't lose to Tamatsuka, either!

14:53.720 --> 14:55.810
We won't lose!

14:55.810 --> 14:59.390
Damn, I want a good looking boyfriend!

14:59.390 --> 15:01.310
Sanae, come on...

15:01.310 --> 15:02.580
It's fine, it's fine.

15:09.320 --> 15:12.570
So the repairs are done with your house, huh, Amuro?

15:12.570 --> 15:13.640
Yep.

15:14.650 --> 15:18.600
I don't have a problem with staying at your house forever.

15:18.600 --> 15:20.360
No, thanks.

15:20.360 --> 15:22.520
I can finally sleep comfortably.

15:23.170 --> 15:25.830
Won't you feel lonely, Kaname-chan?

15:27.740 --> 15:29.990
I feel lonely.

15:30.990 --> 15:31.990
Amuro.

15:33.170 --> 15:34.460
W-Well...

15:35.360 --> 15:38.770
Hey, you said that you'd give me a reward, right?

15:39.620 --> 15:42.630
If I won at the Kantou tournament, I would get a reward.

15:42.630 --> 15:44.570
Y-Yeah...

15:44.570 --> 15:47.080
She's being pushy...

15:47.080 --> 15:49.820
What does she mean by reward?

15:49.820 --> 15:52.830
If it continues like this, it'll probably...

15:54.640 --> 15:58.420
Kaname-chan, let me have my reward...

16:00.170 --> 16:01.460
Amuro.

16:03.060 --> 16:04.350
I got it.

16:04.350 --> 16:06.610
Promises are promises.

16:15.160 --> 16:16.660
That's not it!

16:16.660 --> 16:18.980
Amuro is not like that!

16:19.380 --> 16:22.320
I want to make a wonderful memory with Kaname-chan.

16:22.320 --> 16:23.110
Wonderful?!

16:23.110 --> 16:23.930
Memory?!

16:23.930 --> 16:25.130
I was right!

16:26.630 --> 16:27.940
So...

16:29.740 --> 16:30.610
Yes...

16:35.250 --> 16:37.050
So swim with me.

16:38.600 --> 16:40.340
Hey, let's swim.

16:41.670 --> 16:42.480
No!

16:42.480 --> 16:44.740
I definitely can't do that!

16:45.780 --> 16:47.850
See, I don't have a bathing suit on.

16:47.850 --> 16:50.690
Just swim naked.

16:51.850 --> 16:54.610
Hey, I can't be naked.

16:55.910 --> 16:59.130
Sir, this is a misunderstanding!

17:01.890 --> 17:03.710
That's a...

17:05.840 --> 17:06.960
Looks tasty.

17:06.960 --> 17:09.220
Is he planning on eating Ono-chan?!

17:09.570 --> 17:12.720
He did say that he's eaten a dolphin before.

17:12.720 --> 17:13.470
This isn't good, Amuro!

17:13.470 --> 17:15.570
We have to stop him!

17:15.570 --> 17:16.540
Oh.

17:16.540 --> 17:17.720
What do you mean, "oh"?

17:21.990 --> 17:23.310
Help!

17:23.310 --> 17:24.680
Amuro!

17:25.260 --> 17:26.980
Let's swim, let's swim!

17:42.200 --> 17:43.600
Hey!

18:17.130 --> 18:19.870
Mermaid...

18:33.500 --> 18:35.050
That's it!

18:35.050 --> 18:36.340
It was you, Amuro!

18:37.850 --> 18:38.850
What?

18:39.200 --> 18:42.970
I was mistaking you for a mermaid.

18:43.400 --> 18:45.330
I was helped by you, Amuro.

18:46.870 --> 18:48.060
Amuro!

18:49.000 --> 18:50.610
So that's what it is.

18:53.600 --> 18:54.610
He got away again!

18:55.190 --> 18:58.690
You should give up, Dad.

18:59.320 --> 19:03.520
Ono-chan is smart, so he gets away every time.

19:03.520 --> 19:04.870
So that's how it is.

19:06.210 --> 19:07.890
You two are so close, even underwater.

19:07.890 --> 19:09.720
No, it's not like that.

19:09.720 --> 19:11.250
Very close!

19:12.340 --> 19:14.340
Take care of her!

19:14.340 --> 19:16.860
I said that it's not like that.

19:16.860 --> 19:20.490
Kaname-chan, let's swim at Churaumi next.

19:25.770 --> 19:31.350
The excitement from the Kantou tournament died down, and the Umisho swim team went back to its usual ways.

19:34.670 --> 19:39.340
Everyone got lazy as soon as the Kantou tournament ended.

19:39.340 --> 19:41.990
It's because Okky hasn't gone out on a date with me.

19:41.990 --> 19:43.370
That's right!

19:43.370 --> 19:46.910
You promised that I could shave you after the Kantou tournament!

19:47.260 --> 19:51.080
Makio wants to eat ice cream until I'm full.

19:51.430 --> 19:54.460
You guys, the only person he's going to listen to is Maaya!

19:54.460 --> 19:56.040
It's okay!

19:56.040 --> 19:58.040
Okky is everyone's!

19:58.040 --> 20:00.240
Why are you talking like that?!

20:00.240 --> 20:01.250
Creep!

20:01.250 --> 20:03.140
I've grown to like it!

20:03.140 --> 20:04.520
You two stay out of it!

20:04.520 --> 20:10.890
I should work up the courage to ask Okiura-kun to buy it for me.

20:15.320 --> 20:19.400
I want to see Shizuoka-san's butt again.

20:19.400 --> 20:22.920
Yep, yep, me too, me too!

20:22.920 --> 20:25.200
I already listened to what you wanted to do, Amuro.

20:25.200 --> 20:27.580
Hey, what does that mean?!

20:28.590 --> 20:30.090
It's always the X-girl.

20:30.090 --> 20:31.210
It's unfair!

20:31.210 --> 20:32.520
I'm gonna shave you!

20:32.520 --> 20:35.030
Ice cream, ice cream, ice cream.

20:35.030 --> 20:35.830
Um...

20:35.830 --> 20:36.750
Butt, butt.

20:38.040 --> 20:39.260
Everyone, calm down!

20:39.260 --> 20:42.260
Orizuka-senpai, please say something!

20:42.700 --> 20:48.780
Well, you probably should listen to what they have to say, so they'll listen to directions.

20:48.780 --> 20:49.910
No way!

20:49.910 --> 20:52.800
I want all the Korean barbecue I can eat.

20:52.800 --> 20:54.780
I want a year's worth of massage.

20:54.780 --> 20:56.730
No...

20:57.290 --> 21:00.420
Why only Amuro-senpai?

21:00.420 --> 21:02.780
So are you two actually going out?

21:04.780 --> 21:06.990
No, no, that's not true!

21:07.750 --> 21:10.300
Amuro-senpai, what's the truth?!

21:11.060 --> 21:12.920
You guys found out?

21:13.870 --> 21:15.000
Hey!

21:18.010 --> 21:20.510
You betrayed Maaya!

21:20.510 --> 21:22.180
How is it?!

21:22.180 --> 21:23.690
Is that true?

21:23.690 --> 21:25.850
Even though I don't have a boyfriend?

21:27.550 --> 21:30.760
E-Everyone, calm down...

21:36.240 --> 21:37.270
Help!

21:38.420 --> 21:39.690
Kaname-chan!

21:39.690 --> 21:41.780
Aren't you glad that you learned how to swim?!

21:41.780 --> 21:45.670
Like I said, I can't swim!
